    "title"             "Knox Relay"
    "description"       "Server-side bridge mod for remote server management. Exports game state, inventory snapshots, player positions, progression, live character vitals and appearance, and processes item delivery and money deposit queues via file-based JSON communication. Provides /account register for linking a character to a website account, /report for filing a player report from inside the game, and a friends list with optional map pins: right-click a survivor to ask, accept from the Knox Desk or the website."
    "changenote"        "[h1]1.37 — Desk stays the current UI[/h1]\n[b]Fixed[/b]\n[list]\n[*]Opening the Knox Desk no longer falls back to the vanilla brown window. Hiding the resize grip no longer calls paginate on widgets that are not rich text, so the rail and pages still build.\n[*]The vanilla inventory title bar, collapse chevron, and status strip no longer paint over the new Desk. Pinning the window no longer brings those old widgets back.\n[*]The Desk title shows the loaded Lua version (KNOX DESK  1.37), so a leftover copy is obvious instead of looking like an unexplained old UI.\n[/list]"
}
